{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"承接S05-5中撑着的劲松动、承认舍不得的变化，并进一步认清所舍不得的是曾经相信的生活，没有新增具体前史。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是对亲近和珍惜之物的普遍愿望，没有添加具体人物关系或真实发生的争抢事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是他希望怎样付出、靠近和看待自身价值，没有把比喻落实成真实对白或具体行为。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"拒绝把向往贬为软弱或幻想是明确的心理判断，过去确实体验过亲近的依据也由S04-2提供。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写出了他从勉强承认心愿到暂时不再审问心愿的心理变化，没有把音乐本身的变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"委屈和思念浮现、满足和柔软回来、疲惫暂时淡去都是内在体验，没有把远方对象或家园写成真实场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"「舍不得回到现实」把珠子中与此前世界隔开、不能永远停留的静谧意象具体化成仿佛身处现实之外再返回的处境；「盼的生活还没真正实现」本身没有越界。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-5已经写出撑着的劲松动后承认舍不得那种不必防备的生活，S06-1只是进一步认清这份不舍的对象。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"珍惜之物已不能像过去那样自然拥有，能解释他为何希望留住它们，但前条没有直接交代「争抢」这一机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-2明确说他仍想要不用时时防备的亲近，足以说明S06-2前半的愿望仍在起作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-4写出他不能示弱、逼自己硬撑，能解释他为何不想再逞强，但不足以单独推出付出只因喜欢、靠近不先防伤以及证明自己值得被爱这一整组愿望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-2明确说他确实因熟悉的亲近快乐过，这段真实体验为他不把眼下的向往视为软弱或幻想提供了依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能顺着「认清所求—说清所求—不再贬低或审问—允许感受回来—承认所盼的生活尚未实现」读懂这段心理过程。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf87f854-5b7f-4c0d-bea0-40c7eedde0a4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T173243935324Z", "elapsed_seconds": 533.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:41:37.786539+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ec66e090708a0db3c4fee679b07c9e8cc4ba2e6632f81f06d684720715b28e7b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T173243935324Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "78c3f7987610fc86470fd6fbd62f9c3ee02e3b1b11e5c655d85eeac7d4a22f74"}}}
